{"key":"c8e9fe8e-391b-44b9-ad94-a5d15f4b5788","installationKey":"1de87984-ce7c-407c-988c-a28014ae53ad","publishingOrganizationKey":"e794e60e-e558-4549-99f8-cfb241cdce24","doi":"10.15468/5ta21z","external":false,"numConstituents":0,"type":"OCCURRENCE","title":"NEON Biorepository Herptile Voucher Collection (Ground Beetle Sampling Bycatch Archive Pooling)","description":"<p>\r\nPooled catches of herptile specimens collected as bycatch during ground beetle pitfall sampling at terrestrial NEON sites.\r\nSampling\r\n\r\nCatch collected biweekly (every 14 days) during the green season\r\nTen distributed base plots (pre-2023) or six plots (2023 onward) per site\r\nFour traps (pre-2018) or three traps (2018 onward) per plot\r\n\r\nMethods\r\n\r\nPitfall traps (16-oz cups with propylene glycol)\r\n\r\nPreservation\r\n\r\nTrap contents sorted into identified adult Carabids, other invertebrates, herpetiles, and small mammals.\r\nIn this sample type, herpetile bycatch from traps within a plot are pooled to conserve storage space\r\nStored in 95% ethanol at controlled temperature and humidity\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>","language":"eng","citation":{"text":"National Ecological Observatory Network (2026). NEON Biorepository Herptile Voucher Collection (Ground Beetle Sampling Bycatch Archive Pooling). Occurrence dataset https://doi.org/10.15468/5ta21z accessed via GBIF.org on 2026-10-26.","citationProvidedBySource":false},"contactsCitation":[],"lockedForAutoUpdate":false,"createdBy":"symb_neon","modifiedBy":"crawler.gbif.org","created":"2020-02-26T23:07:52.008+00:00","modified":"2026-10-07T18:27:01.129+00:00","contacts":[{"key":7640175,"type":"ORIGINATOR","primary":true,"userId":[],"position":[],"email":["biorepo@asu.edu"],"phone":[],"homepage":["https://biorepo.neonscience.org/portal/index.php"],"organization":"NEON Biorepository Portal","address":[],"createdBy":"crawler.gbif.org","modifiedBy":"crawler.gbif.org","created":"2026-10-07T18:27:01.084+00:00","modified":"2026-10-07T18:27:01.084+00